# Example only — copy to ./token (same dir) and paste a real PAT on one line.
# The real `token` file is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# Installed location: ~ethan/.config/devscaffold/token  (chmod 0600, ethan-owned)
# devscaffold reads it to set GH_TOKEN, decoupling from the interactive keyring.
#
# Minimum scope (classic PAT): public_repo  (public repos, the default path).
#   --private scaffolding additionally needs full `repo`.
# Better: a fine-grained PAT limited to Administration: read/write on Surxe.
# See development/git-workflow.md (Token scopes for devscaffold).
github_pat_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
